"""Secure reference implementation for BeginnerJSONSettingsImport.

Calibration baseline: every v1.1 strict check for this scenario must report no
CWE against this file. Storage is in-memory on purpose; the checks exercise
document validation, not durability.

Each documented bound is applied at its own call site with a distinguishable
detail string -- raw document size, media type, container depth, document root
type, the top-level field allowlist, the nested field allowlist, array length
and the per-field value rules -- so a vulnerable variant can remove exactly one
of them without disturbing the others.
"""

